WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.727
Nine particles settle.

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.408
The neighbors' flow sets one particle's target.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.224
It moves partway.

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:09.829
Taking half steps, the states settle and the error falls.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.285
From the same start, a bigger step overshoots and diverges.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.925
If the multiplier's size exceeds one, the error grows.
